    "# ## 8. Prepare 2026 Predictions\n",
    "# \n",
    "# The sample submission contains IDs like `2026_1101_1102`. We'll extract team IDs, then compute features using the **most recent season** (e.g., 2025) stats and rankings. We don't have 2026 seeds, so we'll set seed difference to 0 (or we could use ranking as proxy).\n",
